# tests/ holds jq fixtures that CI runs from the repo (scripts/test-*.py). They are not part of the
# chart: `helm package` would otherwise ship them, and Helm stores a chart's non-template files in
# every release record — the Secret that must stay under Kubernetes' 1 MiB cap (see
# scripts/lint-release-size.py, which models templates and files/ only, so it cannot see them).
tests/
